.png", "id": "753444965348905", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75404385_753444968682238_1351648608584461325_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=skATriv1swkQ7kNvwGGk7SI&_nc_oc=AdkvQY_1bcRFksxMpkclW0ECSa92YrsyV0yB2iqw_7iYyFkMXdkmWCrpcDpKhoqagWs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsbjA-vVMvl2SCNQBbE1G-VYJTjjCy1tUKwy1Xh4UcLDw&oe=69A19938"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "AriaLandscape1.png", "id": "2109575492517992", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75307246_2109575499184658_3892853235703191564_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tK4CSTgkD4sQ7kNvwEuXHdu&_nc_oc=AdnDcVX985Z3p6Mf1Yhc2q_vTEbuB4vfQfcKzJ9TTIzjZMZvKzAf98IZrAF6AhS_ROk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs1vejejyhFOnk5D-538ahCdLC443hy_zG-OW4dNGRDwg&oe=69A1A22A"}, "display_name": "Aria", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Will you stay alive until the end of the music?\n\nAria is an action game both relaxing by its bucolic landscapes (Africa, Japan, Canada...) and upbeat by its beautiful and vigorous classical compositions. Do not hesitate anymore, take your bow and fight your ennemies to the sound of Tcha\u00efkovski, Wagner, Handel... \n\nAfter being released on rift, the game has been improved for the quest to delivered an even more fun experience.", "short_description": "Will you stay alive until the end of the music?\n\nAria is an action game both relaxing by its bucolic landscapes (Africa, Japan, Canada...) and upbeat by its beautiful and vigorous classical compositions. Do not hesitate anymore, take your bow and fight your ennemies to the sound of Tcha\u00efkovski, Wagner, Handel... \n\nAfter being released on rift, the game has been improved for the quest to delivered an even more fun experience."}]}, "developer_name": "Gregory Campion", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.aria-vr.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "p